Therefore, this Court deems it appropriate to direct the father to pay an interim maintenance of Rs.25,000/- per month to the minor child, which shall be remitted directly to the School or to the - 22 - NC: 2025:KHC:7801 account of the mother.
Accordingly, IA.No.VI is partly allowed.
